{"3093910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dokkalfar: The Ballads of Vivi the Dark Elf", "steam_appid": 3093910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist and Follow Dokkalfar!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/42ec5d7137841e592980cd73ac03657b.avif?t=1785223036\" width=608 height=227 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/780ac2f16cbaff08745784e4b1f11211.avif?t=1785223036\" width=620 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Dokkalfar</u> is a modern <u>Metroidvania</u> following Vivi, a Dark Elf hunter tracking the sorcerer Erasmus and his cult across a vast fantasy realm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast, acrobatic movement and shadow magic as you fight, explore, and uncover the truth behind a forbidden power capable of awakening ancient horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every path forward is shaped by your abilities, equipment, and choices as you grow stronger through fluid traversal and reactive combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vivi's journey comes to life through beautifully hand-drawn illustrations during dialogue and narrative screens, all set to an original soundtrack with melodic, memorable compositions that define its dark atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/0820f31833279c94aafd9d28c4d79829.webp?t=1785223036\" width=620 height=34 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> <u>Play as a Dark Elf Hero</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/82dccd637294ea72526a1d03fe1522a7.poster.avif?t=1785223036\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/82dccd637294ea72526a1d03fe1522a7.webm?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/82dccd637294ea72526a1d03fe1522a7.mp4?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain</strong> together <strong>slides</strong>, <strong>evades</strong>, <strong>and</strong> aerial <strong>dashes</strong> to fluidly navigate complex environments and aggressive encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike from a distance with Vivi’s signature <strong>whip</strong>, execute precise counters with her <strong>parry</strong> dagger, or debilitate foes with <strong>poisoned</strong> <strong>darts</strong>. Adapt your approach by equipping <strong>weapons</strong> <strong>and</strong> <strong>gear</strong> <strong>found</strong> <strong>throughout</strong> <strong>the</strong> <strong>realm</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine acrobatic movement with your arsenal to dictate the rhythm of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Master Shadow Magic</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/7739451ecc2d2440f9d5e2d88e59acef.poster.avif?t=1785223036\" width=426 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/7739451ecc2d2440f9d5e2d88e59acef.webm?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/7739451ecc2d2440f9d5e2d88e59acef.mp4?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Elf magic is subtle, precise, and lethal. Vanish from sight with <strong>shadow</strong> <strong>cloak</strong>, peer through darkness with <strong>heightened</strong> <strong>perception</strong>, and blink through hazards using <strong>Shadow</strong> <strong>Step</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your <strong>power</strong> <strong>grows</strong>, unleash darkness orbs, life-draining attacks, and <strong>levitation</strong> to dominate hostile territory and turn it into your personal hunting ground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forbidden techniques expand your control over both combat and the <strong>hidden</strong> <strong>paths</strong> of the world.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Choose your approach</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/68064880521f39b8a851dbc9d3f842a4.poster.avif?t=1785223036\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/68064880521f39b8a851dbc9d3f842a4.webm?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/68064880521f39b8a851dbc9d3f842a4.mp4?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early in your journey, Vivi is guided by mentors who introduce different approaches to combat and magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can specialize in weapons, focus on shadow magic, or blend both into your own style. Some techniques and equipment are tied to your chosen direction, while others remain available to all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you commit to a focused build or forge your own hybrid approach, your playstyle  evolves through the choices you make.<strong> </strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Level Up and Build Vivi</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/2c5812146b6f2f38760c64b79130bb10.poster.avif?t=1785223036\" width=426 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/2c5812146b6f2f38760c64b79130bb10.webm?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/2c5812146b6f2f38760c64b79130bb10.mp4?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat</strong> <strong>enemies</strong> and <strong>complete</strong> <strong>quests</strong> to <strong>gain</strong> <strong>experience</strong> to <strong>level</strong> <strong>up</strong>, Leveling up improves Vivi's core attributes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> new <strong>abilities</strong> and discover weapons, armor, and relics that not only increase power, but change how Vivi fights, moves, and explores the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different equipment, stats, and resistances to shape loadouts that suit your preferred playstyle.<strong> </strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Face Powerful Enemies</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/9c9a7bcfdf17e5cef44366e9759baccf.poster.avif?t=1785223036\" width=426 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/9c9a7bcfdf17e5cef44366e9759baccf.webm?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/9c9a7bcfdf17e5cef44366e9759baccf.mp4?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is overrun with corrupted creatures, ancient monsters, and the cult of the sorcerer Erasmus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters are relentless and demand constant movement, timing, and awareness as enemies close distance, control space, and punish hesitation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive by weaving together traversal, shadow magic, and weapons as you adapt to increasingly dangerous threats.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore an interconnected Fantasy World</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across a connected world of frozen tundra, ancient jungles, abandoned mines, haunted forests, forgotten dungeons, and villages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden paths, secret rooms, and optional rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock shortcuts and fast travel as new abilities open previously unreachable places.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/0820f31833279c94aafd9d28c4d79829.webp?t