iques and equipment are tied to your chosen direction, while others remain available to all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you commit to a focused build or forge your own hybrid approach, your playstyle  evolves through the choices you make.<strong> </strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Level Up and Build Vivi</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/2c5812146b6f2f38760c64b79130bb10.poster.avif?t=1785223036\" width=426 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/2c5812146b6f2f38760c64b79130bb10.webm?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/2c5812146b6f2f38760c64b79130bb10.mp4?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat</strong> <strong>enemies</strong> and <strong>complete</strong> <strong>quests</strong> to <strong>gain</strong> <strong>experience</strong> to <strong>level</strong> <strong>up</strong>, Leveling up improves Vivi's core attributes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> new <strong>abilities</strong> and discover weapons, armor, and relics that not only increase power, but change how Vivi fights, moves, and explores the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different equipment, stats, and resistances to shape loadouts that suit your preferred playstyle.<strong> </strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Face Powerful Enemies</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/9c9a7bcfdf17e5cef44366e9759baccf.poster.avif?t=1785223036\" width=426 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/9c9a7bcfdf17e5cef44366e9759baccf.webm?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/9c9a7bcfdf17e5cef44366e9759baccf.mp4?t=1785223036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is overrun with corrupted creatures, ancient monsters, and the cult of the sorcerer Erasmus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters are relentless and demand constant movement, timing, and awareness as enemies close distance, control space, and punish hesitation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive by weaving together traversal, shadow magic, and weapons as you adapt to increasingly dangerous threats.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore an interconnected Fantasy World</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across a connected world of frozen tundra, ancient jungles, abandoned mines, haunted forests, forgotten dungeons, and villages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden paths, secret rooms, and optional rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock shortcuts and fast travel as new abilities open previously unreachable places.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/0820f31833279c94aafd9d28c4d79829.webp?t=1785223036\" width=620 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/ce5f7ce6d25ff19facaee41a558c5c59.avif?t=1785223036\" width=620 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Become Vivi, a shadow-wielding dark elf who hunts a sorcerer’s cult with speed and precision. Dash through enemy attacks, parry deadly strikes, and master acrobatic movement and shadow magic as you explore a dangerous dark fantasy world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/f5a5e1b505faafbdffcb756bc5a13dd33dbb1629/header.jpg?t=1785223036", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/5131074bbe25e7a944b03c781ff0ac4cec3e53c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785223036", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/5131074bbe25e7a944b03c781ff0ac4cec3e53c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785223036", "website": "https://megaquest.gg", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Steam Deck Compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_